OL,3,AParade commemorates 9/11 Cornish hero
OL,4,
OL,5,FA parade and ceremony has honoured a
OL,6,FCornish hero who died saving thousands
OL,7,Fof lives during the 9/11 World Trade
OL,8,FCenter attacks in New York 25 years
OL,9,Fago.
OL,11,FRick Rescorla was head of security for
OL,12,FMorgan Stanley and was working in the
OL,13,FSouth Tower on 11 September 2001. He
OL,14,Fevacuated more than 2,500 people from
OL,15,Fthe building before returning inside -
OL,16,Fhis body was never found.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
