OL,3,AParade commemorates 9/11 Cornish hero
OL,4,
OL,5,FChildren from Hayle's Penpol Primary
OL,6,FSchool, where Rescorla was a former
OL,7,Fpupil, took part in the parade
OL,8,Falongside members of the Royal Navy,
OL,9,FBritish Army, Royal Air Force and
OL,10,FParachute Regiment.
OL,12,FHayle town clerk Eleanor Giggal said
OL,13,Fthey wanted future generations to
OL,14,Fremember what Rescorla did.
